\section{Wall-rate draft}
The symbols are listed without a wall model, and the draft does not adopt the formula.
\[
q_c=\frac{kA\Delta T}{L}
\]
This state has no relation authority.

\section{Wall-rate specification}
The revised specification now explicitly adopts steady one-dimensional conduction through one plane wall for $q_c,k,A,\Delta T,L$.
\[
q_c=\frac{kA\Delta T}{L}
\]
Only the revised snapshot is under review.
